---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Device Compatibility — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="DroidDeck device compatibility reports for Android handhelds and Snapdragon phones. Real tests, settings, and known issues."
  page="devices"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:24px}
    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}
    .card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#b8d7f0}
    .card i{font-size:32px;color:#168fd5;margin-bottom:16px;display:block}
    .card h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px}
    .card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px}
    .card .meta{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px}
    .card .meta span{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f0f7fc;color:#147cb9}
    .card a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#147cb9}
    .status-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px}
    .status-good{background:rgba(22,163,74,.1);color:#16a34a}
    .status-mixed{background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);color:#d97706}
    .status-limited{background:rgba(220,38,38,.1);color:#dc2626}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Device Compatibility</div>
        <h1>Will it run on your device?</h1>
        <p>Hands-on DroidDeck reports for Android handhelds and Snapdragon phones. Each page includes launch results, recommended settings, and known issues.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line"></i> Verified</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Ayn Odin 2</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 8 Gen 2</span>
            <span>Adreno 740</span>
          </div>
          <p>Excellent thermal headroom and solid Adreno 740 performance. One of the most reliable Android handhelds for DroidDeck.</p>
          <a href="/devices/ayn-odin-2/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-mixed"><i class="ri-error-warning-line"></i> Mixed</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line"></i> Community</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Retroid Pocket 5</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 865</span>
            <span>Adreno 650</span>
          </div>
          <p>Adreno 650 is below the official recommended GPU tier. Lighter titles and older indie games work; heavy 3A is a struggle.</p>
          <a href="/devices/retroid-pocket-5/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line"></i> Verified</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Ayaneo Pocket S</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD G3x Gen 2</span>
            <span>Adreno 740</span>
          </div>
          <p>Premium build with strong sustained performance. The large screen makes it ideal for FSR-upscaled games.</p>
          <a href="/devices/ayaneo-pocket-s/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-smartphone-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line"></i> Community</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 Phones</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 8 Gen 3</span>
            <span>Adreno 750</span>
          </div>
          <p>Highest phone-class performance. Pair with a clip-on controller or docking solution for the best experience.</p>
          <a href="/devices/snapdragon-8-gen-3/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-smartphone-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line"></i> Verified</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 Phones</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 8 Gen 2</span>
            <span>Adreno 740</span>
          </div>
          <p>Widely available and well-tested. Great balance of performance, price, and community knowledge.</p>
          <a href="/devices/snapdragon-8-gen-2/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Highly Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line"></i> Community</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Ayn Odin 2 Portal</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 8 Gen 3</span>
            <span>Adreno 750</span>
          </div>
          <p>Large-screen Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 handheld with active cooling. The current benchmark for dedicated Android handhelds.</p>
          <a href="/devices/odin-2-portal/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-smartphone-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Highly Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line"></i> Community</span>
          </div>
          <h3>ROG Phone 9</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 8 Elite</span>
            <span>Adreno 830</span>
          </div>
          <p>Fastest phone-class option with vapor-chamber cooling. Best paired with a clip-on controller or dock.</p>
          <a href="/devices/rog-phone-9/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-smartphone-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-good"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line"></i> Verified</span>
          </div>
          <h3>RedMagic 9 Pro</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 8 Gen 3</span>
            <span>Adreno 750</span>
          </div>
          <p>Great-value gaming phone with a built-in turbofan and shoulder triggers. Strong sustained performance.</p>
          <a href="/devices/redmagic-9-pro/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-mixed"><i class="ri-error-warning-line"></i> Mixed</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line"></i> Community</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Retroid Pocket 4</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>SD 865</span>
            <span>Adreno 650</span>
          </div>
          <p>Budget handheld with the same SoC as Pocket 5 but only 4 GB RAM. Good for 2D indie games, limited for 3A.</p>
          <a href="/devices/retroid-pocket-4/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <span class="status-badge status-limited"><i class="ri-close-circle-line"></i> Not Recommended</span>
            <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line"></i> Community</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Retroid Pocket 4 Pro</h3>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>Dimensity 1100</span>
            <span>Mali-G77</span>
          </div>
          <p>Uses MediaTek/Mali, which is not officially supported by DroidDeck. Most users cannot launch games reliably.</p>
          <a href="/devices/retroid-pocket-4-pro/">Read full report <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
